From 4ad467e315cc15ee1d5dffb451a53d3c8a0a0ac5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 06:14:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(laporan): revert grid tile to placeholder (real screen
 renders blank)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

LaporanScreen was pushed to the real, DB-wired screen (queries
transactions + cash_expenses). In testing it renders as just the
iOS header with nothing below — most likely a build-time exception
while assembling the report body (stat cards / trend chart / list),
since that would blank only the Expanded content area and leave the
header (a separate widget higher up the tree) painting fine. Not yet
isolated further, and this environment has no Flutter/Dart toolchain
to reproduce and confirm it live.

Swap the tile back to a plain placeholderTile (matching Staff) so
the menu entry is safe to ship in the meantime, exactly like every
other not-yet-finished tile. laporan_screen.dart and its provider/
repository are untouched — only the import and the tile wiring in
menu_grid_items.dart changed, so re-enabling later is a one-line
revert of this commit.
---
 .../presentation/menu_grid_items.dart           | 17 ++++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/lib/features/menu_shell/presentation/menu_grid_items.dart b/lib/features/menu_shell/presentation/menu_grid_items.dart
index b0bf7e8..770ebfd 100644
--- a/lib/features/menu_shell/presentation/menu_grid_items.dart
+++ b/lib/features/menu_shell/presentation/menu_grid_items.dart
@@ -7,7 +7,6 @@ import '../../arus_kas/presentation/arus_kas_screen.dart';
 import '../../cabang/presentation/manajemen_cabang_screen.dart';
 import '../../dompet/presentation/dompet_screen.dart';
 import '../../hpp_opname/presentation/hpp_opname_screen.dart';
-import '../../laporan/presentation/laporan_screen.dart';
 import '../../menu_management/presentation/menu_management_screen.dart';
 import '../../pelanggan/presentation/pelanggan_screen.dart';
 import '../../pengaturan/presentation/pengaturan_screen.dart';
@@ -101,12 +100,16 @@ List<MenuGridItem> buildMenuGridItems({
       color: AppColors.tilePelanggan,
       onTap: () => pushDestination((_) => const PelangganScreen()),
     ),
-    MenuGridItem(
-      label: 'Laporan',
-      icon: Icons.pie_chart_rounded,
-      color: AppColors.tileLaporan,
-      onTap: () => pushDestination((_) => const LaporanScreen()),
-    ),
+    // Temporarily reverted to a plain placeholder (same as Staff) — the
+    // real LaporanScreen (lib/features/laporan/) renders blank in
+    // testing, most likely because it queries `transactions` /
+    // `cash_expenses` (owned by POS/Arus Kas) on open and something in
+    // that cross-feature read is failing before any error/empty state
+    // can paint. Root cause not yet isolated; swap this back to
+    // `pushDestination((_) => const LaporanScreen())` (restoring the
+    // laporan_screen.dart import above) once it's fixed — the built
+    // screen itself was left untouched.
+    placeholderTile(label: 'Laporan', icon: Icons.pie_chart_rounded, color: AppColors.tileLaporan),
     placeholderTile(label: 'Staff', icon: Icons.badge_rounded, color: AppColors.tileStaff),
     MenuGridItem(
       label: 'HPP',
-- 
